    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Small <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jedi\" title=\"Jedi\">Jedi</a> characters such as Master Yoda favor the Short Lightsaber, sometimes called a Shoto Lightsaber. <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jedi\" title=\"Jedi\">Jedi</a> skilled at two-weapon fighting often use the Shoto as their off-hand weapon of choice. </p><p>A Short Lightsaber requires a special <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a> to operate (the cost is ten times the price of an ordinary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a>, but lasts almost indefinitely). </p><p><b>Special:</b> Can be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> </p>",
